fbc_preview.description:
PV format, timezone-aware timestamps, 15-minute intervals and full next-72-hour coverage passed. Any selected load input also passed its coverage and interval checks.

PV intervals: {count}
Start: {start}
End: {end}
Peak PV power: {peak} W
PV energy over the displayed period: {energy} kWh
PV source age (information only): {age} minutes
Building load: {load}

Timestamps use UTC. FBC plans through local midnight. No load selection keeps the original PV-only calculation; selecting load feeds predicted PV surplus into the same calculation engine.

import_preview.description:
The forecast format, 15-minute continuity, complete next 72 hours passed.

Validated intervals: {count}
Start: {start}
End: {end}
Peak power: {peak} W
Energy over this period: {energy} kWh
Source age (information only): {age} minutes

Timestamps use UTC. Submit to register this shared input. The source is checked again before saving and whenever it changes, and at least once a minute. Multiple modules can use this input.

